# Contact Form

- Keep validation centralized in `src/lib/contact/schema.ts`; client and server behavior should agree with that schema.
- Keep provider configuration in `src/lib/contact/config.ts`. Never hard-code secrets, recipient emails, API keys, or Turnstile secrets.
- Preserve the server-side Turnstile verification flow before sending email.
- Preserve Resend integration boundaries in `src/lib/contact/resend.ts`; route handlers should stay thin.
- Return user-safe errors from the API. Log or expose only information that is safe for production.
- When changing form fields, update the schema, client draft handling, API payload, and email payload together.
